      "writtenOn": "2024-02-12T17:52:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Vendor hooks must not violate this assertion. Your vendor hook makes sure that `in_args` is 1 so it would be totally safe to put the `BUG_ON` outside the conditional in case someone else\u0027s implementation does violate this assertion.\n\nPut the `BUG_ON` at line 935 (after the hook). This will also get rid of the checkpatch warning about \"crashing the kernel\" since you will no longer be adding a `BUG_ON`.",
      "parentUuid": "90f02694_82e8947f",
      "revId": "842037ecc88c307259f10643c7f2fcfb14e4865a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
